# 复现实验：第三方克隆、虚拟环境、原始帧不入库；只入库 manifest / 报告 / 脚本
LEFS/experiments/_vendor/
LEFS/experiments/*/.venv/
LEFS/experiments/*/raw/
LEFS/experiments/*/episodes/

# 可由 episodes 重建的中间二进制：训练数据快照、模型权重、解析后逐拍转储
# （episodes/ 本身不入库，权重因此不可由仓库重建，需要时按 *_REPORT.md 的命令重跑训练）
LEFS/experiments/*/data/*.npz
LEFS/experiments/*/runs/*/model.pt
LEFS/experiments/*/runs/**/model.pt
LEFS/experiments/*/*/samples.jsonl

# 幻灯片生成过程的中间态
LEFS/.slidep/
LEFS/tmp/
LEFS/experiments/*/*_stale/

